    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75882" body-key="">
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μέντοι,</span></b> 
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>surely not, verily not</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.294
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				21.370
			</span></i>. </div>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μέντοι . . γε</span>
			<i>not however</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.104
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				231
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μέντοι ἀλλ᾽ ἴσως γε</span>
			<i>not but that</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				62b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μέντοι ἀλλὰ καί . . γε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					173b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in interrog., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μέντοι</span> . . <i>; surely . . , is it
				not so?</i> where an affirm. answer is expected, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				229b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prt.</u>
				309a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				339b
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
